{"type":"text","timestamp":1794360000548,"sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","part":{"id":"prt_1c830c011001XQbF4516DqzXQJ","messageID":"msg_1c830b066001BKFLEkX7VluZQz","sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","type":"text","text":"<think>Now, let's set up the frontend dependencies. First update package.json with the new devDependencies, then npm install to update the lock.\n\nFrontend deps:\n- react 19.3.1, react-dom 19.3.1 (existing)\n- devDependencies: @vitejs/plugin-react 6.2.1, vite 8.3.5, tailwindcss 4.3.5, @tailwindcss/vite 4.3.5, typescript 7.0.2, @types/react 19.3.0, @types/react-dom 19.3.0\n\nLet me install.</think>\n\nBackend written. Now the frontend toolchain:","time":{"start":1794360000530,"end":1794360000545}}}
