{"type":"text","timestamp":1794360055216,"sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","part":{"id":"prt_1c8319577001mkOKYd5koMpnXz","messageID":"msg_1c83178d0001k7QktYG2uxtljD","sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","type":"text","text":"<think>Installed. Let me check the lock file was updated and verify the versions installed.\n\nNow create the frontend config files: tsconfig.json, tsconfig.node.json, vite.config.ts with tailwind plugin, src/index.css.\n\nTypeScript 7 — let me check the `tsc` version and make sure a basic tsconfig works. TS 7 (native) may have different defaults but should support standard tsconfig.\n\nLet me write:\n\ntsconfig.json:\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"lib\": [\"ES2022\", \"DOM\", \"DOM.Iterable\"],\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"verbatimModuleSyntax\": true,\n    \"noUnusedLocals\": true,\n    \"noUnusedParameters\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": true,\n    \"types\": [\"vite/client\"]\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src\"],\n  \"references\": [{ \"path\": \"./tsconfig.node.json\" }]\n}\n```\n\nHmm, with TS 7, `moduleResolution: bundler` works. Let me keep it simple and avoid project references to reduce risk:\n\ntsconfig.json includes src and vite.config.ts? vite.config.ts needs node types for `defineConfig` import — no, it doesn't need node types. But `vite.config.ts` uses `path`? No. Let me include only \"src\" and add a separate tsconfig.node.json referenced... Simpler: one tsconfig including [\"src\", \"vite.config.ts\"], with types [\"vite/client\"]. The vite.config.ts uses only vite imports, fine.\n\nLet me check TS 7 supports `\"types\": [\"vite/client\"]` — yes.\n\nLet me write the files.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794360055159,"end":1794360055183}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794360055216,"sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call-5878d975-298d-45b3-a84a-900d0ec7d2ab","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"lib\": [\"ES2022\", \"DOM\", \"DOM.Iterable\"],\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"verbatimModuleSyntax\": true,\n    \"moduleDetection\": \"force\",\n    \"noUnusedLocals\": true,\n    \"noUnusedParameters\": true,\n    \"noFallthroughCasesInSwitch\": true,\n    \"types\": [\"vite/client\"]\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src\", \"vite.config.ts\"]\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/tsconfig.json","time":{"start":1794360055166,"end":1794360055189}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c8319579001tMhpR5ZyO243qn","sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","messageID":"msg_1c83178d0001k7QktYG2uxtljD"}}
