{"type":"text","timestamp":1794360183612,"sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","part":{"id":"prt_1c8338b25001QpiAkUhValZWW6","messageID":"msg_1c83349f8001CguX9FD6SMpT2C","sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","type":"text","text":"<think>Now the Dashboard and App.\n\nDashboard.tsx:\n- state: filters, page, pageSize, entries, totals, projects, loading, error, refreshCounter\n- useEffect to fetch.\n\nAlso when filters change, reset page to 1.\n\nLet me write:\n\n```tsx\nexport default function Dashboard({ username, onSignOut }) {\n  const [filters, setFilters] = useState<EntryFilters>({start_date:\"\", end_date:\"\", project:\"\"});\n  const [page, setPage] = useState(1);\n  const [pageSize, setPageSize] = useState(25);\n  const [entries, setEntries] = useState<EntriesResponse>({items:[],total:0,page:1,page_size:25});\n  const [totals, setTotals] = useState<SummaryItem[]>([]);\n  const [projects, setProjects] = useState<string[]>([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string|null>(null);\n  const [refreshKey, setRefreshKey] = useState(0);\n\n  useEffect(() => { ... }, [filters, page, pageSize, refreshKey]);\n```\n\nNote: filters object identity changes on each update → effect re-runs. Good.\n\nFor projects: fetch separately whenever refreshKey changes (after create/delete/save).\n\n```tsx\nuseEffect(() => {\n  let cancelled = false;\n  listProjects().then(p => !cancelled && setProjects(p)).catch(() => {});\n  return () => { cancelled = true; };\n}, [refreshKey]);\n```\n\nThe entries + totals effect:\n```tsx\nuseEffect(() => {\n  let cancelled = false;\n  setLoading(true);\n  (async () => {\n    try {\n      const [list, summary] = await Promise.all([\n        listEntries(filters, page, pageSize),\n        fetchSummary({start_date: filters.start_date, end_date: filters.end_date}),\n      ]);\n      if (cancelled) return;\n      setEntries(list);\n      setTotals(summary);\n      setError(null);\n    } catch (caught) {\n      if (cancelled) return;\n      setError(caught instanceof ApiError ? caught.message : \"Could not load entries.\");\n    } finally {\n      if (!cancelled) setLoading(false);\n    }\n  })();\n  return () => { cancelled = true; };\n}, [filters, page, pageSize, refreshKey]);\n```\n\nCareful: `fetchSummary` doesn't take project (matches summary CSV semantics).\n\nHandlers:\n- handleFiltersChange(next) { setFilters(next); setPage(1); }\n- refresh() { setRefreshKey(k => k+1); }\n\nSign out: call logout API (optional) then clearSession and setSession(null). I'll call the API logout endpoint then clear. Since the API is authenticated with the token; if it fails, still clear locally.\n\nApp.tsx:\n```tsx\nexport default function App() {\n  const [session, setSession] = useState<Session | null>(() => loadSession());\n  useEffect(() => { setUnauthorizedHandler(() => setSession(null)); }, []);\n  if (!session) return <AuthView onAuthenticated={setSession} />;\n  return <Dashboard username={session.username} onSignOut={() => { clearSession(); setSession(null); }} />;\n}\n```\n\nNote: the unauthorized handler should also clear the session (clearSession is called in api.request before the handler). Good.\n\nmain.tsx: import \"./index.css\".\n\nLet me write Dashboard.tsx.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794360183589,"end":1794360183607}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794360183715,"sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call-97d23858-f985-462f-818e-5e55a3922422","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import { useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { ApiError, fetchSummary, listEntries, listProjects } from \"../api\";\nimport type { EntriesResponse, EntryFilters, SummaryItem } from \"../types\";\nimport EntryForm from \"./EntryForm\";\nimport EntryList from \"./EntryList\";\nimport FiltersBar from \"./FiltersBar\";\nimport TotalsPanel from \"./TotalsPanel\";\n\nconst emptyFilters: EntryFilters = { start_date: \"\", end_date: \"\", project: \"\" };\n\ninterface Props {\n  username: string;\n  onSignOut: () => void;\n}\n\nexport default function Dashboard({ username, onSignOut }: Props) {\n  const [filters, setFilters] = useState<EntryFilters>(emptyFilters);\n  const [page, setPage] = useState(1);\n  const [pageSize, setPageSize] = useState(25);\n  const [entries, setEntries] = useState<EntriesResponse>({\n    items: [],\n    total: 0,\n    page: 1,\n    page_size: 25,\n  });\n  const [totals, setTotals] = useState<SummaryItem[]>([]);\n  const [projects, setProjects] = useState<string[]>([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [refreshKey, setRefreshKey] = useState(0);\n\n  function refresh() {\n    setRefreshKey((value) => value + 1);\n  }\n\n  function handleFiltersChange(next: EntryFilters) {\n    setFilters(next);\n    setPage(1);\n  }\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    let cancelled = false;\n    listProjects()\n      .then((names) => {\n        if (!cancelled) setProjects(names);\n      })\n      .catch(() => undefined);\n    return () => {\n      cancelled = true;\n    };\n  }, [refreshKey]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    let cancelled = false;\n    setLoading(true);\n    (async () => {\n      try {\n        const [list, summary] = await Promise.all([\n          listEntries(filters, page, pageSize),\n          fetchSummary({ start_date: filters.start_date, end_date: filters.end_date }),\n        ]);\n        if (cancelled) return;\n        setEntries(list);\n        setTotals(summary);\n        setError(null);\n      } catch (caught) {\n        if (cancelled) return;\n        setError(caught instanceof ApiError ? caught.message : \"Could not load your entries.\");\n      } finally {\n        if (!cancelled) setLoading(false);\n      }\n    })();\n    return () => {\n      cancelled = true;\n    };\n  }, [filters, page, pageSize, refreshKey]);\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-100\">\n      <header className=\"border-b border-slate-200 bg-white\">\n        <div className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4 sm:px-6\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <div className=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 text-sm font-bold text-white\">\n              T\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <h1 className=\"text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Timesheet</h1>\n              <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Signed in as {username}</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            onClick={onSignOut}\n            className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition hover:bg-slate-50\"\n          >\n            Sign out\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <main className=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-5 px-4 py-6 sm:px-6\">\n        {error ? (\n          <p className=\"rounded-xl bg-rose-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-rose-700 ring-1 ring-rose-200\">\n            {error}\n          </p>\n        ) : null}\n\n        <EntryForm projects={projects} onCreated={refresh} />\n\n        <FiltersBar filters={filters} projects={projects} onChange={handleFiltersChange} />\n\n        <div className=\"grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_18rem]\">\n          <EntryList\n            items={entries.items}\n            total={entries.total}\n            page={entries.page}\n            pageSize={pageSize}\n            loading={loading}\n            onPageChange={setPage}\n            onPageSizeChange={setPageSize}\n            onChanged={refresh}\n          />\n          <TotalsPanel items={totals} loading={loading} />\n        </div>\n      </main>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/Dashboard.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/Dashboard.tsx","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/components/Dashboard.tsx","time":{"start":1794360183602,"end":1794360183616}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c8338b29001E97zTeSncE0MW9","sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","messageID":"msg_1c83349f8001CguX9FD6SMpT2C"}}
