{"type":"text","timestamp":1794360212815,"sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","part":{"id":"prt_1c833fd43001ngNy1hatc3Cqho","messageID":"msg_1c833f2a8001CGoBBEX1lvomeo","sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","type":"text","text":"<think>The requirements.lock uses `--require-hashes` mode with hashes for the pinned versions. The flask pin in requirements.txt (3.1.3) doesn't match the lock's flask version? Let me check the lock file for flask's version and hashes.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794360212803,"end":1794360212813}}}
