{"type":"text","timestamp":1794360531067,"sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","part":{"id":"prt_1c838d86a001jfeWR0DT55i4jt","messageID":"msg_1c838ba92001Bc3jE2wZw6Sn36","sessionID":"ses_e37d2cb66ffeKlDfh1f9c34oTg","type":"text","text":"<think>jsdom installed in /workspace/.uitest (outside the frontend package, so it doesn't pollute the app's package.json/lock).\n\nNow let me create a vite SSR build config for the test and the test script.\n\nActually, simpler: I can bundle the app source for Node using vite's `build.ssr` with the frontend root. Let me create /workspace/.uitest/vite.test.config.ts and run vite from the frontend dir with `--config`.\n\nWait: vite config `root` matters for resolving node_modules; the frontend's node_modules has react. If the config file is in .uitest, vite resolves imports relative to root. Let me set root: \"/workspace/frontend\" and build.ssr entry \"/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx\".\n\nLet me write the config as .mjs (plain JS) to avoid TS config loading issues:\n\n```js\nimport react from \"@vitejs/plugin-react\";\nimport { defineConfig } from \"vite\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  root: \"/workspace/frontend\",\n  plugins: [react()],\n  build: {\n    ssr: true,\n    outDir: \"/workspace/.uitest/dist\",\n    emptyOutDir: true,\n    minify: false,\n    rollupOptions: {\n      input: \"/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx\",\n      output: { format: \"cjs\", entryFileNames: \"app.cjs\" },\n    },\n  },\n});\n```\n\nBut `@vitejs/plugin-react` and `vite` must be resolvable from the config file location (/workspace/.uitest) → they're in /workspace/frontend/node_modules. Node resolution from the config file's directory won't find them. I can import with absolute paths: `import react from \"/workspace/frontend/node_modules/@vitejs/plugin-react/dist/index.mjs\"` — messy. \n\nAlternative: put the test config inside the frontend dir (temporarily) as `vite.test.config.ts` and delete it after. Then resolution works. Let me do that: /workspace/frontend/vite.test.config.ts (temporary, deleted later).\n\nThen run: `npx vite build --config vite.test.config.ts` from /workspace/frontend.\n\nLet me write it.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794360531050,"end":1794360531064}}}
